    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n62831" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λῆδος</span></b> , 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λᾶδος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εος</span>, τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>a cheap common dress</i>, esp. <i>a light summer
				dress</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Alcm.
				97
			</span></i> (so <i><span class="en">
				Did.
			</span></i>; <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λᾶιδος</span></b> 
			<i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>): more freq. in 
				Dim.
			 forms, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λήδιον</span> or
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ληδίον, τό</span>, and <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ληδάριον</span>
			(qq.v.).</div>
